    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "指标口径",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## TimeGraph 核心验收\n\n共享拓扑按 request/query 记录终态，兼容 multi_resource 按 route 区分 vm_legacy/timegraph。固定数据源、实例范围、请求窗口和并发，比较失败与 partial、阶段成本、输入/存储/输出及请求预算。阶段存在包含关系，不相加；物理输入不重复累计 Matrix 复用。节点/边输出为展开出现次数，字节预留是估算值；进程 RSS、Go heap 和普通查询影响使用对应服务监控。无样本不补为零。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "共享拓扑请求与子查询结果",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "bkmonitor-timeseries-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_BKMONITOR}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "source": "sum by (scope, query_mode, result) (rate(unify_query_cmdb_topology_operations_total[5m]))",
          "type": "range",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "bkmonitor-timeseries-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_BKMONITOR}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
